Context: 4. Deputation (Duty) Allowance

- (c) prospectively or from a retrospective date;  
Pay in the deputation post to be refixed on promotion/appointment to Non-Functional Selection Grade and revision of scales of pay in parent cadre post, on the basis of revised/same option of the employees. If the initial option was for pay scale of deputation post and no change in option envisaged, pay already drawn in deputation post will be protected if the pay refixed is less.
